Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:25:23 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(collect): protocol save validation, sync collect
 settings and data-map API (C5c)

- ProtocolRules: expression, FRAME_RULE / PARSE_RULE JSON v1, EXPECT_RULE checks (same rules as
  Desktop RuleReader; shared vectors desktop/tests/.../TestData/rule_vectors.json tested on both sides)
- Protocol CRUD (Action v1, optional fields only): group frameRule/cmdGapMs/initRoutine/initDelayMs,
  protocol ptlRoles/ptlAction/expectRule/idempotentYn. Roles/type consistency checked only when roles
  are set; values re-sent unchanged are not re-checked (GTEC0000 legacy non-JSON PARSE_RULE keeps working).
  Protocol referenced by group INIT_ROUTINE: delete 409, change to RX_STREAM 400.
- Sync response: group frameRule/cmdGapMs/initRoutine[]/initDelayMs, protocol roles[]/action/expect/idempotent
- GET /api/core/sync/data-map?devCd= (Client chain, GET only)
- Requires migration 08 (C5b) in the DB. No DB change, no new dependency.

